    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Grace Kerongo, a current member of the web team at Nation Media Group (NMG), never anticipated the profound impact that Aga Khan University's Executive Masters in Media Leadership and Innovation (EMMLI) would have on her career. While she initially entered the programme with a focus on digital journalism, Grace quickly discovered that EMMLI offered much more: a comprehensive approach to leadership, innovation, and sustainability in media.",
